WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.200
Welcome back to Building
Ticket-to-Machine.

2
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:06.312
This is Chapter 5: the re-read
rule, the kit's Build 2.

3
00:00:06.312 --> 00:00:08.524
A success response is not closure.

4
00:00:08.524 --> 00:00:12.750
Neither is a ticket status, and neither
is a comparison against nothing.

5
00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:17.575
A finding closes only when a re-read of
the target shows the intended state.

6
00:00:17.575 --> 00:00:22.612
A ServiceNow business rule enforces that,
and a Python client does the re-reading.

7
00:00:22.612 --> 00:00:27.081
This chapter adds an offline mode so you
can watch every decision on a laptop,

8
00:00:27.081 --> 00:00:29.400
and a guard against closing on nothing.
